OL,3,APassengers unlikely to be due
OL,4,Acompensation after air traffic control
OL,5,Aglitch, says regulator
OL,6,
OL,7,FHundreds of thousands of people are
OL,8,Fthought to have been affected by flight
OL,9,Fcancellations and delays, caused by an
OL,10,Fair traffic control issue on Tuesday
OL,12,FTransport Secretary Heidi Alexander
OL,13,Fapologises "wholeheartedly to
OL,14,Fpassengers" and asks the UK Civil
OL,15,FAviation Authority to conduct an
OL,16,Findependent review
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,304,300,200,140,0,100
