OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,APassengers unlikely to be due
OL,4,Acompensation after air traffic control
OL,5,Aglitch, says regulator
OL,6,
OL,7,FIn a statement, the regulator says the
OL,8,Fissue is "likely to be considered the
OL,9,Fresult of 'extraordinary
OL,10,Fcircumstances'" meaning people are
OL,11,F"unlikely to be entitled to
OL,12,Fcompensation for delays or
OL,13,Fcancellations" directly caused by the
OL,14,Fglitch
OL,16,FThroughout the day, images have shown
OL,17,Fpassengers sleeping on airport floors,
OL,18,Fwith aviation analytics firm Cirium
OL,19,Fsaying more than 340 flights were
OL,20,Fcancelled today - around 5% of the
OL,21,Ftotal
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
